#, python-format
msgctxt "about.description"
msgid ""
"_The Discord bot for Webcam Magic._\n"
"\n"
"Having issues with SpellBot? Please [report bugs](%(issues)s)!\n"
"\n"
"[🔗 Add SpellBot to your Discord!](%(invite)s)\n"
"\n"
"SpellBot's continued operation is made possible by [PlayEDH](https://www.playedh.com/) and my Patreon supporters.\n"
"\n"
"💜 Help keep SpellBot running by [becoming a patron!](%(patreon)s)"
msgstr ""
"_Discord-botti kohteessa Webcam Magic._\n"
"\n"
"Ongelmia SpellBotin kanssa? [Ilmoitathan virheistä](%(issues)s)!\n"
"\n"
"[🔗 Lisää SpellBot Discordiisi!](%(invite)s)\n"
"\n"
